Third-party data referenced from this repo
---------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository references but does not redistribute the following datasets:

  Intracardiac Atrial Fibrillation Database (IAFDB)
  PhysioNet, doi:10.13026/C23S33
  Distributed under the Open Data Commons Attribution License v1.0 (ODC-By v1.0)
  https://physionet.org/content/iafdb/1.0.0/

The IAFDB raw data must be downloaded directly from PhysioNet per its terms.
The `iafdb-pipeline` component repo provides a thin downloader script.

